——稻香\r\n2:11:36-2:15:14——痒\r\nPs：2:14:53——大臭猪来咯\r\n2:15:50-2:19:39——やさしさに包まれたなら\r\n2:20:39-2:25:39——逆さまの蝶\r\n2:26:10-2:30:10——龙卷风\r\n2:39:10-2:43:21——君の知らない物語\r\n2:43:25-2:46:30——绿光\r\n2:47:02-2:51:11——化作泪水\r\n2:53:08-2:58:06——晓之车\r\n最后——爆刘继芬\r\n水姐下班了，嗨呀好痛苦哇啊\r\n[emot=acfun,1686/]没什么时间所以整理的很慢","images":[],"likes":7}},{"key":"video:17967952","id":"17967952","kind":"video","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"b5a300c55ca321b3fca782fb"},"time":1600484994542,"text":"","title":"【超感动】朋友【十年后ver】","images":[],"cover":"6702511d08ebdf69064de704","duration":"5:22","views":6599,"counts":{"commentCount":121,"likeCount":4331,"bananaCount":25521,"shareCount":27},"url":"https://www.acfun.cn/v/ac17967952","hotComment":{"id":"385169694","user":{"id":"1089872","name":"小雨时晴","avatar":"ad2de37b9df8c38e11e26ee3"},"text":"这时候发一个一楼，我不信还有人来挂我。[emot=acfun,2263/][emot=acfun,2263/][emot=acfun,2263/][emot=acfun,2263/]","images":[],"likes":14}},{"key":"video:17817435","id":"17817435","kind":"video","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"b5a300c55ca321b3fca782fb"},"time":1599670945463,"text":"","title":"【水曜日龙王】9.9中文歌回全程（全程翻车）","images":[],"cover":"5457e9331b50736e2ba1d75a","duration":"192:10","views":5193,"counts":{"commentCount":103,"likeCount":4907,"bananaCount":25516,"shareCount":11},"url":"https://www.acfun.cn/v/ac17817435","hotComment":{"id":"308995763","user":{"id":"1286790","name":"それでいいよ","avatar":"f01edf5bc0cc284cc8266a27"},"text":"遇见——00:00-01:08\r\n传奇——01:10-04:47\r\n红色高跟鞋——07:55-11:16\r\n我不难过——11:45-16:26\r\n一辈子的孤单——20:24-24:35\r\n进来了！→ 坐下来了！（坐地上了！)——24:35-28:03\r\n钩指起誓——28:04-31:24\r\n绿光(英语口胡萌混过关)——31:31-34:41\r\n    ps：她绿了！——33:27\r\n月牙湾——34:47-39:49\r\n    ps：歪嘴龙王( just do it ! )——38:18\r\n点赞了！→站起来了！——39:51\r\n寒武纪——39:55-44:36\r\n\t前方连续打嗝——40:02\r\n开到茶蘼——44:37-49:10\r\n白月光——49:35-54:00\r\n刀马旦( just do it ! )——54:08-57:18\r\n仙剑问情——57:19-1:01:17\r\n世界末日——1:01:37-1:05:31\r\n天黑黑——1:05:41-1:09:18\r\n听妈妈的话（憋不住笑了，要变成李宗盛力）——1:09:20-1:13:45\r\n天下无双1:14:20-1:19:19\r\n难念的经——1:19:42-1:21:18\r\n月西江——1:23:18-1:25:18\r\n囍——1:26:17-1:28:35\r\n刀剑如梦——1:29:29-1:32:54\r\n雨蝶——1:33:15-1:37:00\r\n痒——1:37:10-1:40:53\r\n一生所爱——1:41:03-1:45:10\r\n美丽新世界——1:45:43-1:49:15\r\n新贵妃醉酒(水子哥来击剑啊！🤺🤺🤺🤺🤺)——1:49:19-1:53:31\r\n一直很安静——1:53:51-1:57:40","images":[],"likes":21}},{"key":"video:17762426","id":"17762426","kind":"video","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"b5a300c55ca321b3fca782fb"},"time":1599296979497,"text":"","title":"【入站十周年纪念】三行情书日文版","images":[],"cover":"b5ce72d1196edac5515e6e02","duration":"3:51","views":11135,"counts":{"commentCount":164,"likeCount":4428,"bananaCount":26510,"shareCount":29},"url":"https://www.acfun.cn/v/ac17762426","hotComment":{"id":"306706867","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"[size=14px]《三行情书》日语版[/size]\r\n\r\n原词/作曲/原唱：小勒个朵 （[resource id=15629201 type=2 icon=https://ali-imgs.acfun.cn/udata/pkg/acfun/icon_comment_pc_vid_18_3.png]猴山专属小情歌《三行情书》Acer联合共创[/resource]）\r\n编曲：石头大人AVI.\r\n日语填词：精霊酱seirei（https://m.acfun.cn/v/?ac=15928388&amp;sid=245c067fffbb6928）\r\n（日语填词改：水曜日）\r\n\r\n萝莉音：\r\n雨だ    風も吹く   スイカ食って満足\r\n下雨了今天风挺大  吹着空调 啃大西瓜\r\n豆乳みたい   平凡な毎日   君を好き   になった\r\n豆浆油条   平凡生活打卡 喜欢的刚好  是你啊\r\nかみが    白く変わっても  手のひらに     好きを書ける\r\n等鬓角颜色  偷偷溜走蒸发   我还能在你手心      画写肉麻\r\nほら　かえる　 　蝉時雨      また夏だ\r\n池塘小青蛙~  听蝉它叫啦  又一个盛夏\r\nミルクティの味は　　　　　　君と私のようだ     \r\n我和你  间~的混搭      像牛奶遇到~红茶\r\n素直な笑顔に　　　　　　　桃味のバナナ\r\n还有桃子味~  banana   配你咧嘴笑~的虎牙\r\nももはなが咲いた   心ときめいた\r\n桃花开艳压~  群鸦  我心底叽叽~喳喳\r\n「もしもし」と聞いたら\r\n那“在吗在吗~你在吗”\r\nすぐ答えよう\r\n保证秒回答\r\n\r\n少女音：\r\n春も    秋も  巡って    朝も   夜も 一緒で\r\n无论是 春去或 秋来    陪伴过 晨烟或暮霭\r\n今は今を  抱き  しめ\r\n与我而言 拥抱~ 每个“现在” \r\n思いを告げたい\r\n都是最长情~的告白\r\n昔は上手くいかない\r\n我的人生曾无从下笔编排\r\n君のお　かげで   変わった\r\n你的出现　让思绪  汹涌澎湃\r\nひとごみで   きみがいる\r\n看人山人海   你无处不在\r\nあ いしてる\r\n我 终将去爱\r\n\r\n少女音：\r\n頂点を経験したあと  平凡のままでいい\r\n尝过人生百味   方知平淡就好\r\n谷底を味わったあと   知足の方がいい\r\n经历繁华苍凉   才知知足就好\r\n人生は長くない   無駄にしないように\r\n人生不长       不辜负便好\r\n君は宇宙の隅の     星空\r\n你是宇宙一隅   是晨星一片\r\n世界と出会った最初の奇跡\r\n是我发现的世界最初的奇迹\r\n太陽と月    山水も同様に\r\n日月不可及  山水同天地\r\n十三年ずっと  君のそばにいる\r\n我想伴着你   十三年不离不弃\r\n次の十三年も  よろしくね\r\n接下来的十三年 也请多多关照了","images":[],"likes":53}},{"key":"video:17736662","id":"17736662","kind":"video","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"b5a300c55ca321b3fca782fb"},"time":1599124604796,"text":"","title":"【直播录像】说好的杂谈回结果8分钟之后就开始了唱歌……","images":[],"cover":"dbbc3082f588192e0e8cf4b7","duration":"169:03","views":4582,"counts":{"commentCount":80,"likeCount":4705,"bananaCount":24506,"shareCount":6},"url":"https://www.acfun.cn/v/ac17736662"}],"media":{"3c2e60a644bf6fddfdd34c8f":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/o_1eiv62u6il1f1edta0e41o17sj0.jpeg?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/kimg/bs2/zt-image-host/ChYwOGU4Yzk5YTAyMTBjNGY0ZTI4YjAzEIvK1y8.jpg","https://ali-imgs.acfun.cn/kimg/bs2/zt-image-host/ChYwOGU4Yzk5YTAyMTBjNGY0ZTI4YjAzEIvK1y8.jpg"]},"4a79756d383e3b68b1d97bf6":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/o_1einbrrie18ol18e4155u17plmfl0.jpeg?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/kimg/bs2/zt-image-host/ChYwODk5ZGJjYjAxMTBlZWMyYTFkMTAyEIvK1y8.jpg","https://ali-imgs.acfun.cn/kimg/bs2/zt-image-host/ChYwODk5ZGJjYjAxMTBlZWMyYTFkMTAyEIvK1y8.jpg"]},"5457e9331b50736e2ba1d75a":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/o_1ehpl0hr91c4g14hlqnm15kjugv0.jpeg?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/kimg/bs2/zt-image-host/ChYwOGEwYWFiNTAxMTA5MTgyZmVhNTAxEIvK1y8.jpg","https://ali-imgs.acfun.cn/kimg/bs2/zt-image-host/ChYwOGEwYWFiNTAxMTA5MTgyZmVhNTAxEIvK1y8.jpg"]},"54bc5d61574dafc2c1066661":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/o_1ej41t0ju10g314al18un1gqu105l0.jpeg?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/kimg/bs2/zt-image-host/ChYwODlkYTE5YjAyMTBjZWM0ZDhjYzAzEIvK1y8.jpg","https://ali-imgs.acfun.cn/kimg/bs2/zt-image-host/ChYwODlkYTE5YjAyMTBjZWM0ZDhjYzAzEIvK1y8.jpg"]},"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/179922_d1f3e455380346a0bdd3ebec5b12996f.png","fallbacks":["https://tx-fr